  "limitations": [
    "Single-machine, one observation per configuration; no statistical performance gate.",
    "App CPU only. Native hitches and complete descendant lifecycle/exit CPU are unavailable.",
    "All full benchmark measurement states remain incomplete and comparisons not-comparable.",
    "Pan rows failed declared trajectory checks and cannot certify optimization gains.",
    "Post-pan click probe failed on both baseline and candidate, so the probe does not establish restored input capability.",
    "First-render stack sampling misses approximately the first 0.293 s after process launch; the replacement 1 s sample ends before the scheduled drag probe.",
    "Original 4 s startup sample overlaps the interaction probe and is retained only as mixed startup/interaction evidence.",
    "Diagnostic sample stack counts include sampling bias; non-wait counts are not exact CPU percentages and inclusive categories overlap.",
    "The cloud-30 body retry repeats only the failed scene after an untimed waiting-execution preparation; it does not replace the successful idle observation.",
    "No GPU time, FPS, energy, N=5/N=20 scaling or combination of candidates was measured.",
    "30 fps alternatives are superseded by the user requirement; their numbers do not certify the 120 fps candidate.",
    "120 fps paired observations use the built-in display; older observations use the 60 Hz external display. Do not pool them.",
    "Configured CA frame-rate requests and 120 fps asset sampling are not physical presentation evidence. Existing capture runs at 5 Hz.",
    "WindowServer resource inspection was unavailable without elevation. No privileged performance service was started.",
    "Background decode timing is not end-to-end first-use latency. Initial texture submission/presentation was not measured.",
    "Fixed 8 s loop, one palette/path, per-card phase, 180x110 frame resolution and opacity fade are prototype styling tradeoffs.",
    "Display changes were tested by moving the actual owned window; changing system refresh settings, display removal and >120 Hz panels were not tested.",
    "Production source is unchanged; only this investigation record is committed and merged locally.",
    "The prototype retains up to two decoded appearance atlases until process exit; all-completed warm-cache footprint was not measured."
